<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Quick Fix - Sign In</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        body { background-color: #2b2b2b; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; font-family: 'Prompt', sans-serif; }
        .auth-card { background-color: #eef5e8; width: 100%; max-width: 500px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        .auth-header { background-color: #2f2f2f; padding: 15px 30px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .auth-header h1 { color: #f4c430; font-family: serif; font-size: 28px; margin: 0; }
        .auth-header .btn-switch { border: 1px solid #f4c430; color: #ffffff; padding: 6px 18px; border-radius: 20px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; }
        .auth-body { padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; }
        .auth-body h3 { margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 15px; color: #333; }
        .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: left; }
        .form-group label { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .form-control { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px; box-sizing: border-box; }
        .btn-submit { background-color: #f4c430; color: #000; border: none; padding: 10px 40px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 15px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="auth-card">
        <div class="auth-header">
            <h1>Quick Fix</h1>
            <a href="/register" class="btn-switch">Sign up</a>
        </div>
        <div class="auth-body">
            <h3>ยินดีต้อนรับ<br>เข้าสู่ระบบบริการดูแลรถของเรา Quick Fix ยินดีให้บริการ</h3>
            <% if (error) { %>
                <p style="color: red; font-size: 14px;"><%= error %></p>
            <% } %>
            <form action="/login" method="POST">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>ชื่อผู้ใช้ หรือ อีเมล</label>
                    <input type="text" name="username" class="form-control" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>รหัสผ่าน</label>
                    <input type="password" name="password" class="form-control" required>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Sign in</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>